{"3423990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frozen Ship", "steam_appid": 3423990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frozen Ship</strong> is an open-world survival game where you manage an entire city on wheels. Building, crafting, research, medicine, resource gathering, and hunting — you decide what your people will do and how your city will develop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the workday begins, you leave the ship alongside everyone else and set out to explore the frozen world. Gather resources, explore abandoned settlements, complete quests, and encounter other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through cold, hunger, danger, political intrigue, and conflicts between settlements awaits you in a world that no longer forgives mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the captain of the ship</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a global catastrophe that forever changed the planet's climate, you lead an expedition aboard a massive ship capable of crossing the endless snowy wastelands. There is a crew of 20 people, several buildings, supplies, and hope to find a new place to live. Every decision you make affects the fate of your crew and the outcome of the entire mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8bd3c5aa429038628050a3d9057fac4a.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8bd3c5aa429038628050a3d9057fac4a.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8bd3c5aa429038628050a3d9057fac4a.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Living and Dangerous World </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the ship, you'll find a procedurally generated open world filled with dangers and stories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators and deadly enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting, searching for, and gathering resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms, diplomatic, and armed conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned hospitals, shops, homes, railways, and entire cities </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world changes from game to game, creating new situations, routes, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/008186cae1bf1f2364b9b157996b1d38.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/008186cae1bf1f2364b9b157996b1d38.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/008186cae1bf1f2364b9b157996b1d38.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settlements, Factions, and Conflicts </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will encounter survivor settlements — small towns, each with their own rules, problems, and visions for the future. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly and hostile settlements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions involved in prolonged conflicts and those simply trying to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories of survivors, lore, main and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you align with a particular faction or try to maintain a balance between all of them — the choice is yours. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions can shift the balance of power, determine the fate of entire communities, and perhaps influence the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8168a6d6995d96fb98f9ec09785bed0f.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8168a6d6995d96fb98f9ec09785bed0f.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/8168a6d6995d96fb98f9ec09785bed0f.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship and Crew Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is more than just a means of transport — it is a mobile base and home for the entire expedition:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the ship into a living city with its own infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade buildings necessary for living and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enact laws and impose necessary restrictions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign crew members to work inside the ship or gather resources </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your crew’s well-being: illnesses, fatigue, fear, and faith in the expedition’s success — everything matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/5d7e5965ea20995c78cea70facb103f8.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/5d7e5965ea20995c78cea70facb103f8.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/5d7e5965ea20995c78cea70facb103f8.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade and Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the world of Frozen Ship, resources mean life:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make deals to ensure survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell found items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy rare gear and supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests for traders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, a successful deal can save the expedition, while a mistake could lead to disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/9154cd057f9e12114c2fe234a4eb4ebe.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/9154cd057f9e12114c2fe234a4eb4ebe.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/9154cd057f9e12114c2fe234a4eb4ebe.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make impacts the fate of your crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who to entrust the important tasks, who to send on dangerous expeditions, and how to keep the team united in the face of eternal cold — the choices are yours.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frozen Ship</strong> is an open-world survival game where you manage an entire city on wheels. Building, crafting, research, medicine, resource gathering, and hunting — you decide what your people will do and how your city will develop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the workday begins, you leave the ship alongside everyone else and set out to explore the frozen world. Gather resources, explore abandoned settlements, complete quests, and encounter other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through cold, hunger, danger, political intrigue, and conflicts between settlements awaits you in a world that no longer forgives mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.poster.avif?t=1787003187\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.webm?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/62e191cf28e8840599b7d5877aa61f32.mp4?t=1787003187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the captain of the ship</strong>. </p><p clas